sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  participant MC as Mission client
  participant DC as Distributed coordinator :8093
  participant DSE as DistributedSimulationEngine
  participant D1 as drone-worker d-01 :8085
  participant D2 as drone-worker d-02 :8086
  participant D3 as drone-worker d-03 :8087
  participant D4 as drone-worker d-04 :8088
  participant NA as Mission narrator :8084
  participant OL as Ollama :11434

  Note over MC,OL: Phase 2b — green = mission path · blue = per-drone sync Tasks · amber = optional copilot

  rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
    Note right of MC: Long-running mission Task (JSON-RPC + SSE)
    MC->>DC: GET Agent Card
    DC-->>MC: sar:distributed-flock-coordinator
    MC->>DC: SendMessage mission:search-rescue
    DC->>DSE: DistributedSimulationRunner.run()
    DSE->>DSE: SectorAllocator + Flock.fromMissionTargets()
    DC-->>MC: SSE artifact sar-flock-assignment
  end

  rect rgb(227, 242, 253)
    Note right of DSE: Init — one short A2A Task per drone (remote mode)
    par Parallel init RPCs
      DSE->>D1: SendMessage drone:init JSON
      D1-->>DSE: Task COMPLETED (ack)
      DSE->>D2: SendMessage drone:init JSON
      D2-->>DSE: Task COMPLETED (ack)
      DSE->>D3: SendMessage drone:init JSON
      D3-->>DSE: Task COMPLETED (ack)
      DSE->>D4: SendMessage drone:init JSON
      D4-->>DSE: Task COMPLETED (ack)
    end
  end

  rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
    loop Each sim tick until all landed or maxTicks
      Note over DSE: Tick barrier — coordinator merges searched matrix
      DSE->>DSE: copySearchedMatrix()
      par One sync Task per drone this tick
        DSE->>D1: SendMessage drone:tick + searchedMatrix
        D1->>D1: SimDrone.step()
        D1-->>DSE: TickResponse JSON + updated matrix
        DSE->>D2: SendMessage drone:tick
        D2-->>DSE: TickResponse JSON
        DSE->>D3: SendMessage drone:tick
        D3-->>DSE: TickResponse JSON
        DSE->>D4: SendMessage drone:tick
        D4-->>DSE: TickResponse JSON
      end
      DSE->>DSE: applySearchedMatrix() · transfer flocks on target found
      opt target found → reassign searchers
        DSE->>D2: SendMessage drone:reassign
        D2-->>DSE: Task COMPLETED
      end
      opt all targets found
        DSE->>D1: SendMessage drone:rtb
        D1-->>DSE: Task COMPLETED
      end
      DSE-->>DC: DroneTelemetry × N
      DC-->>MC: SSE artifact sar-telemetry
      MC->>MC: detect significant event
    end
    DSE-->>DC: SimulationResult
    DC-->>MC: SSE artifact sar-mission-summary
    DC-->>MC: Task COMPLETED
  end

  rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
    opt SAR_NARRATOR_URL set — async copilot (same as Phase 2)
      MC->>NA: SendMessage narrate:event
      NA->>OL: POST /api/generate
      OL-->>NA: prose briefing
      NA-->>MC: sar-narrative + COMPLETED
    end
    MC->>MC: SarVizExporter → replay.json
  end

  Note over DSE,D4: Flock physics stay deterministic — LLM never in tick loop
